WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.212
Today might not feel worth keeping. A year from now, it will.

2
00:00:06.112 --> 00:00:12.331
Talk about it anyway: the song on repeat, what's bugging you, the thing your friend said.

3
00:00:13.231 --> 00:00:19.133
Seal it until a day you pick. Until then, you can't watch it, and search can't find it.

4
00:00:20.033 --> 00:00:23.524
A year later, the app knocks, and it opens.

5
00:00:24.074 --> 00:00:26.624
[From the capsule] I sat with Nadia at lunch. She's funny.

6
00:00:27.524 --> 00:00:33.839
Back then, she was just someone you sat with at lunch. Now she's the first person you call.

7
00:00:34.739 --> 00:00:38.235
Your time capsules wait under Capsules, in your journal.
